  "design": [
    "Unchanged configured Node fs.js glob/globSync and internal/fs/promises.glob execute over genuine host filesystem primitives.",
    "One bundled-dependency table drives physical resolution and immutable embedding; original bundles use CommonJS regardless of vendor package scope.",
    "Original Node Dirent owns shape, methods and parentPath; native file_type supplies real file/directory/symlink/device/FIFO/socket data. Internal metadata has a null prototype and directory names use native lexical ordering.",
    "Native fs is cached before original utilities initialize; a private directory-policy owner captures the actual constructor without a circular second fs instance.",
    "Original glob exports install when fs is required. Programs without fs avoid policy initialization; traversal keeps the original lazy import."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "All-parallel goal remains open: newest completed frozen c4f stable1789/5015 and pinned1817/4727 exclude this newer source. Selected gains are not added to full scores.",
    "Six existing failures remain in the18-case selected family. Full glob suite currently reaches node:test suite-skip behavior; permission and other filesystem gaps remain.",
    "First focused run exposed bundled-source format detection before embedded fallback and was fixed. First complete369/370 exposed eager initialization increasing child startup cost; initialization moved to fs. Same final source then369/370 during a concurrent full audit, but unchanged isolated300ms control passes and a complete quiet370/370 qualifies final source. All actual failing attempts retained; no deadline changed.",
    "No speed claim: fixed-work8valid0clean."
  ],
